<title>GREECE: Table of Greek central bank fixing rates, July 22.</title>
<headline>Table of Greek central bank fixing rates, July 22.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     July 22     July 21   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  283.610     282.000     247.020   14.81 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.520     309.800     306.830    0.88 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.500     156.970     158.970   -1.55 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.404	46.450	47.182   -1.65 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  474.840     472.380     419.180   13.28 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.025     139.450     141.685   -1.88 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.085	16.127	16.185   -0.62 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  244.050     243.240     212.430   14.88 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.859	 1.863	 1.888   -1.54 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.551	 1.554	 1.581   -1.90 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  190.845     190.720     183.135    4.21 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
